 "language_probability": 0.9717846512794495,
 "text": "I know I cannot be the only one who has that one room that never warms up. You turn the heat up for the whole house, and that room is still cold. So this little heater just goes wherever you are. Bedroom in the morning, your desk during the day, the couch at night. It's 1500 watts and heats up fast, and it's quiet. You set the exact temperature right on top or with the remote, and there's an eco mode. The only problem? Whoever gets it first is not giving it back. Grab one for the bedroom and one for your desk before the cold really hits. It's in the orange cart.",
